  "structuralConclusions": [
    "The twenty construction assurances are policy content and do not appear in any of the three XML schemas.",
    "Individual and Mandatory are structurally identical after replacing their target namespace and namespace prefix.",
    "The base profile has one additional required version element and uses a namespaced coreSchemaVersion attribute; the other profiles use a local fixed FormVersion attribute.",
    "All three DAT workbooks mark signature, title, applicant organization, and submitted date required even though the XSD permits the corresponding content elements to be absent.",
    "The instructions make title and applicant organization prepopulation explicit for base and Mandatory and leave both editable for Individual."
  ]
